  "type": "river",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "即今汉江，是长江最长的支流。上源玉带河出陕西宁强县，东流到勉县东和褒河汇合后称汉江，在武汉入长江",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-09",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "即今汉江，是长江最长的支流。上源玉带河出陕西宁强县，东流到勉县东和褒河汇合后称汉江，在武汉入长江"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-09",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "北流注于渭。清水出焉，南流注于汉水。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-10",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "又西三百二十里，曰嶓冢之山，汉水出焉，而东南流注于沔；嚣水出焉"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-11",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，一说指朝鲜半岛的汉江；一说可能指松花江"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "貊国在汉水东北，地近于燕，灭之。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-12",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "一说此处应作“濮(pú)水”，濮水又称濮渠水，上游分两支，合流于今河南长垣县西"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-12",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "汉水出鲋鱼之山，帝颛顼葬于阳，九嫔"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "水轻利而宜禾，渭水多力而宜黍，汉水重安而宜竹，江水肥仁而宜稻。平"
    }
  ],
